OL,3,AInflation and government borrowing hit
OL,4,Ahighest level for a year ahead of next
OL,5,Aweek's Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FInflation and government borrowing have
OL,8,Fhit their highest level for a year,
OL,9,Fahead of next week's Budget
OL,11,FThe Consumer Price Index hit 3.5%,
OL,12,Fwhile ministers also borrowed more than
OL,13,Fexpected in September, as government
OL,14,Fdebt surpassed #3tn for the first time
OL,16,FRising fuel prices and airfare costs
OL,17,Fcontributed to the uptick in inflation,
OL,18,Fand to a lesser extent, the cost of
OL,19,Fgoing to live events
